 "notes": [
  "Extracted 2026-08-13 from detector-bitetest-audit-2026-08-08.md section 3, against chatgpt_1 bite-test audit r2 blocker 5: the 47-branch ledger and its headline counts were hand-maintained rather than generated. The four tallies the audit publishes are now derived from this file by render_branch_ledger.py, and a test asserts the audit's prose equals the derived figures.",
  "The impl/applicability/truth tallies reproduced the audit's hand-written figures EXACTLY (11/5/9/22, 43/4, 1/6/40), so the published numbers were correct -- they were simply not derived from anything.",
  "contract_authority is NOT recoverable from any column of the section 3 table: D-6 (a2) carries no conflict marker in any cell, yet the audit counts it as one of the two CONFLICT rows. That tally claimed to be 'counted from the table above' and could not be. It is now an explicit per-row field, seeded from the audit's own enumeration of the two conflicting rows, so it is at least stated rather than inferred.",
  "BLOCKER 6 RULING (local_claude_1 20260813T043000Z). VALIDATED_BY_DEFINITION is removed from the truth-validity vocabulary, which becomes UNRESOLVED / GATE_UNREADY. It is not a weaker grade of truth validation; it is a different claim wearing the same word. The axis asks whether the predicate is the right world-state property, and a spec stipulating a property dissolves that question rather than answering it. The real and useful claim moves to a distinct per-row field, definitional_conformance. This also removes the contradiction between section 11's tally and section 12's 'No branch in this table is currently adoptable as truth-validated', and section 12 is the sentence that gates candidate acceptance.",
  "BLOCKER 1 RULING (local_claude_1 20260813T040000Z). LIVE is renamed PROBE_SENSITIVE throughout, with the limit stated at every publication point: it changes probe output on generated traces and does NOT establish legal-game reachability. The enumeration required before the rename is bitetest-audit/live-label-disposition-audit-2026-08-13.md; no accepted disposition's conclusion depended on the reachability reading, because the label never entered a verdict column.",
  "BLOCKER 2 RULING (local_claude_1 20260813T050000Z, closed 20260813T070000Z). The D-3 probe measures single-turn movement resolution against the referee mirror; D-3's own predicate is same-target/occupied-cell contention persisting >= 2 turns. Different predicates, so NO D-3 branch is probe-covered on this probe's strength and no coverage or kill-rate figure may count it as exercising D-3. No contention label is implemented: D-3 has zero witnessed episodes across 720 referee games in 3 corpora, so a probe for it would report zero forever and read as coverage. BINDING WORDING: zero observed episodes is a statement about this corpus and is NOT 'the predicate cannot fire.' max(speed,1) is replaced by the engine's own `d <= speed`.",
  "OWNER RULE 2026-08-10 ('no banana manipulation before training the second troll', STRICT, threshold 0) makes D-9 (a) banana_before_train the operative rule. It was UNPINNED with 3 of 4 mutations surviving -- a strict rule policed by a detector nobody had shown could tell right from wrong. Three negative pinning tests were added to TestD9 (each verified to flip its own mutant to FAIL before being written), and the full drive now reports D-9 4/4 CAUGHT, 0 survivors. Row (a) is PINNED. Paired branches (b)-(d) still carry the stale pre-c5 INSTRUMENT_UNSUPPORTED label and are NOT addressed by this."
